@startuml
title 13.3 Notify User Confirmation - sequence diagram
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 240
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ParticipantBorderColor #444444
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

actor Customer
actor "Shop Manager" as M
participant "View" as V <<View>> #EADCFF
participant OrderController as OC <<Controller>> #D8F3DC
participant ManagerOrderController as MOC <<Controller>> #D8F3DC
participant OrderService as OS <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant ManagerOrderService as MOS <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant OrderStatusListener as L <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant OrderMailSender as MAIL <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant HtmlMailSender as H <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant "SMTP server" as SMTP <<External>> #FFE0E0
database MySQL

== Order receipt after checkout ==
Customer -> V : place order (checkout)
V -> OC : POST /api/orders/{userId}/batch
OC -> OS : makeOrders(userId, request)
OS -> MySQL : INSERT Orders, Order_Details
OS --> MAIL : publish OrderPlacedEvent(orderIds)
note right of MAIL : after the transaction commits, run asynchronously
OC --> V : 201 Created, one order per shop
V --> Customer : order created, cart items removed
MAIL -> MySQL : read orders, details, payments (read-only transaction)
alt customer email missing or not verified
  MAIL -> MAIL : skip, no mail
else can mail
  MAIL -> MAIL : buildReceipt(orderIds)
  MAIL -> H : send(email, subject, html)
  H -> SMTP : send message
  SMTP --> Customer : receipt email
end

== Confirmation after the shop confirms ==
M -> V : click Confirm
note right of V : confirmation dialog before the request
V -> MOC : POST /api/shop/mine/{shopId}/orders/{id}/confirm
MOC -> MOS : confirm(shopId, actor, orderId)
MOS -> MySQL : UPDATE Orders status PENDING to PROCESSING
MySQL --> L : @PostUpdate
L --> MAIL : OrderStatusChangedEvent(PENDING to PROCESSING), after commit
MAIL -> MAIL : buildStatusMail: "Đơn hàng đã được xác nhận"
alt customer email missing or not verified
  MAIL -> MAIL : skip, no mail
else can mail
  MAIL -> H : send(email, subject, html with "Xem đơn hàng" link)
  H -> SMTP : send message
  SMTP --> Customer : confirmation email
end
MOC --> V : 200 OK
V --> M : status PROCESSING

note over MAIL
Status mails are sent only for PROCESSING, DEPOSIT_PAID, DELIVERING,
COMPLETED, CANCELLED and REFUNDED. Other changes are ignored.
A failed send is logged ("Order email skipped") and not retried.
end note

@enduml
